  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Unlocking children&apos;s potential to thrive: Rsearch into taking childhood development (ECD) interventions to scale (THRIVE)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Thrive is a large-scale, multi-country research programme which aims to build understanding of Early Childhood Development (ECD) service delivery models, at scale, and how they can transform to significantly improve childhood health, nutrition, education and wellbeing outcomes in low- and middle-income countries. Thrive seeks comprehensive, practical answers about how ECD systems innovate, improve, and better serve children and communities</narrative>
  </description>
